# T10 — cross-origin isolation headers for maple-hosted.
#
# These two headers opt the page into a cross-origin-isolated context, which
# is required for SharedArrayBuffer and therefore for the WASM rayon thread
# pool (wasm-bindgen-rayon) used by the RAW decode path.
#
# Honoured by both Cloudflare Pages and Netlify. For Vercel, the equivalent
# config is documented in DEPLOY.md under "WASM threading".
#
# Browsers without COOP+COEP (or where this file is missing) continue to
# load the app normally — the JS wrapper detects `crossOriginIsolated` and
# falls back to single-threaded decode.

/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

/raw_wasm_bg.wasm
  Content-Type: application/wasm
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
